            <p class="callout-platform-desc">${z(`handbookOneMovementDesc`,`O-ASIS is the discrete thermodynamic simulation of the Open Networked Earth (O.N.E.) post-work civilization. Explore the 46 articles of the Living Constitution, download the 6-volume thriller novel saga for free, or inspect the open hardware transition roadmap at open-networked-earth.surge.sh.`)}</p>
